{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2012-09", "window": 4, "start_date": 1348358400, "end_date": 1349049599, "month_true_total": 37, "quota": 5, "returned": 4, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:46:42 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "692929", "author": {"steamid": "76561197975671721", "personaname": "Gamerblue", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gamerblue/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 535, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 443, "last_played": 1640899650, "avatar": "f7fdde8bb63841cad1f6993bda23001001aaee23"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of my favorite games. The story and atmosphere is great. The action is fun and this game actually has really fun multiplayer...but sadly youll be playing that with a very small select group.", "timestamp_created": 1348704988, "timestamp_updated": 1348704988, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1311743", "author": {"steamid": "76561197991200027", "personaname": "Comrade Marx", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197991200027/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 958, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 958, "last_played": 1344495600, "avatar": "0ea5300e925bd47b306db6d796fd4916d07e3d88"}, "language": "english", "review": "The red army along with the civilian casualties of world war two numbered in excess of 20 million deaths. The mindset imbued in the typical soviet soldier was one of reckless abandon, the policy of \"not one step back\" ensuring an almost fanatical devotion to the fight. This mindset is well represented by the orc hordes, carelessly throwing their lives away in enormous numbers while attempting to defeat the far better equipped and trained space marine. This interpretation of the battle of Stalingrad, well adapted to a sci-fi setting is a ringing success, conveying both the exhausted determination of the soviets as well as the disillusionment of the fascist opposition. 5/5.", "timestamp_created": 1348451363, "timestamp_updated": 1385421437, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "3175248", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018559357", "personaname": "ux92", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ux92/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 228, "playtime_forever": 206, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 206, "last_played": 1363417200, "avatar": "ec25e53993c89dc25b524a459f57a745fd3b4a37"}, "language": "english", "review": "For every fan of the Warhammer 40,000 series, what would you give to be inside the armor of a space marine, beating Orks with yourself, exploring the universe in your flagship and going on missions? Wonder no more. No more commanding troops from afar. Grab your gear and step into battle!", "timestamp_created": 1348448592, "timestamp_updated": 1348448592, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "647262", "author": {"steamid": "76561197974159619", "personaname": "BossOgg G.", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.